{
  "title": "BandIt recap suggestions",
  "description": "How Elastic orders each attendee's recap suggestions by meaning. SpacetimeDB decides who and what is on the list; Elastic decides only the order.",
  "time_range": {
    "from": "2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "to": "now+1d"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "content": "## Recap suggestions\n\nEach recap suggests the people the attendee hung out with and the booths where they spent time. SpacetimeDB decides who and what is on the list; Elastic only orders it by meaning.\n\n- The query is the attendee's interests text: the zones and booths where they spent the most minutes\n- It is matched (`semantic`) against each person's interests and each booth's description (`semantic_text`)\n- `bandit-indexer` copies booths and findable attendees from SpacetimeDB; `bandit-api` keeps each attendee's latest ranking in `bandit-recap-rankings`"
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "metric",
        "title": "Booths it ranks",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-booths | STATS booths = COUNT()"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "booths"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "metric",
        "title": "Attendees it ranks",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-people | STATS people = COUNT()"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "people"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 32,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "metric",
        "title": "Recaps ranked",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-recap-rankings | STATS recaps = COUNT()"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "recaps"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "metric",
        "title": "First booth changed by meaning",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-recap-rankings | WHERE reordered == true | STATS recaps = COUNT()"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "recaps"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 16
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "data_table",
        "title": "Each attendee's latest ranking: the first booth by meaning next to the first by minutes",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-recap-rankings | EVAL spent_most_time_at = MV_CONCAT(top_spots, \", \") | STATS score = MAX(first_booth_score) BY attendee, spent_most_time_at, first_booth, first_booth_by_minutes, first_person | SORT score DESC | LIMIT 200"
        },
        "rows": [
          {
            "column": "attendee"
          },
          {
            "column": "spent_most_time_at"
          },
          {
            "column": "first_booth"
          },
          {
            "column": "first_booth_by_minutes"
          },
          {
            "column": "first_person"
          }
        ],
        "metrics": [
          {
            "column": "score"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "xy",
        "title": "Booths suggested first most often",
        "layers": [
          {
            "type": "bar_horizontal",
            "data_source": {
              "type": "esql",
              "query": "FROM bandit-recap-rankings | WHERE first_booth IS NOT NULL | STATS recaps = COUNT() BY first_booth | SORT recaps DESC | LIMIT 15"
            },
            "x": {
              "column": "first_booth"
            },
            "y": [
              {
                "column": "recaps"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "xy",
        "title": "People suggested first most often",
        "layers": [
          {
            "type": "bar_horizontal",
            "data_source": {
              "type": "esql",
              "query": "FROM bandit-recap-rankings | WHERE first_person IS NOT NULL | STATS recaps = COUNT() BY first_person | SORT recaps DESC | LIMIT 15"
            },
            "x": {
              "column": "first_person"
            },
            "y": [
              {
                "column": "recaps"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "data_table",
        "title": "The booths it ranks, copied from SpacetimeDB",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-booths | STATS docs = COUNT() BY booth = name.keyword, zone = zone_name, organization = org_name.keyword, tier = sponsor_tier | SORT zone, booth | LIMIT 200"
        },
        "rows": [
          {
            "column": "booth"
          },
          {
            "column": "zone"
          },
          {
            "column": "organization"
          },
          {
            "column": "tier"
          }
        ],
        "metrics": [
          {
            "column": "docs"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
